┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  run_sync("Apple revenue 2024?", deps=deps)         │
│                                                     │
│  round 1:                                           │
│    LLM receives: query + instructions               │
│    LLM decides: I need data → call search_filings() │
│    → tool runs → returns passage text               │
│                                                     │
│  round 2:                                           │
│    LLM receives: query + instructions + tool result │
│    LLM decides: need more → call read_chunks()      │
│    → tool runs → returns chunk text                 │
│                                                     │
│  round 3:                                           │
│    LLM receives: everything so far                  │
│    LLM decides: enough evidence → produce answer    │
│    → returns GroundedAnswer JSON                    │
│                                                     │
│  run_sync returns result                            │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

